- Dynamic-import ConfiguratorSection and BookingPanel (ssr:false) — the two
  heaviest below-the-fold interactive tools, ~530 lines of JS, now load in their
  own client chunks after first paint. CLS-safe fallbacks reserve their height.
- FAQPage JSON-LD built from faqItems (one source of truth) → Google FAQ rich
  results + AI agents can quote the answers verbatim.
- hasOfferCatalog with the six core services → service-level SEO.
- Truthfulness: localBusinessSchema still shipped 'lifetime workmanship
  warranty' to Google (my earlier fix missed the JSON-LD); corrected to
  manufacturer-backed. Fixed stale logo URL (logo.png -> icon-512.png).
- aggregateRating deliberately NOT added (unverified 4.9/348 + Google policy).
